      "explanation": "<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Probability of wining of T<sub>1</sub> against T<sub>2</sub> = 1/2.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Probability of drawing of T<sub>1</sub> against T<sub>2</sub> is = 1/6.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Probability of losing of T<sub>1</sub> against T<sub>2</sub> is = 1/3.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 3 points for win.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1 point for draw.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 0 point for loss.</p>\n<p>P[X = Y] = P(draw) . P(draw) + P(T<sub>1</sub> win) P(T<sub>2</sub> win) + P(T<sub>2</sub> win) . P(T<sub>1</sub> win)</p>\n<p>= (1/6 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1/6) + (1/2 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1/3) + (1/3 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1/2) = 13/36</p>"
